{"projectInfo":{"name":"BGP与BFD联动配置","path":"bgp_bfd","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"在AS 200内使用OSPF作为IGP协议，实现AS内的互通。Router A与Router C之间建立两条IBGP连接。当Router A与Router C之间的两条路径均连通时，Router C与1.1.1.0/24之间的报文使用Router A\u003c－\u003eRouter B\u003c－\u003eRouter C这条路径转发；当Router A\u003c－\u003eRouter B\u003c－\u003eRouter C这条路径发生故障时，BFD能够快速检测并通告BGP协议，使得Router A\u003c－\u003eRouter D\u003c－\u003eRouter C这条路径能够迅速生效。","label":["BGP","BFD"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"AS100","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS100.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AS300","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS300.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterD","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterD.cfg"}]}